/-!
# Noncompact groups generated by three half-turns

Three-center configurations are related to discrete actions, free products and
canonical ideal-triangle fundamental regions. Convex patches compare these regions
with the Nielsen core. The large-parameter case derives its ordinary boundary and
Nielsen signature from the actual generated action.
-/

@[expose] public section
set_option maxHeartbeats 1200000
set_option quotPrecheck false

noncomputable section
set_option autoImplicit false
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
